  "id": "artichoke-spinach-lasagna",
  "name": "Artichoke Spinach Lasagna",
  "subtitle": "A savory layered pasta bake with greens, artichokes, and two cheeses.",
  "description": "Lasagna noodles are layered with rosemary-scented spinach and artichokes, tomato sauce, mozzarella, and feta, then baked until bubbling and tender.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired",
  "yield": {
